#   ⇒ ✅ ②b FINAL v4 — FOUR defects closed, none of them mine to find:
#       biscuit: the instrument · hermes: the baseline · chit: the field index · biscuit: the default
#       ps -eo pid,comm,args > /tmp/box.ps
